<title>FRANCE: Chargeurs International completes Walon.</title>
<headline>Chargeurs International completes Walon.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chargeurs International said on Friday that it had completed the sale of 100 percent of the shares of Walon Iberia to a group of Walon Iberia managers and the Spanish investment firm 3I.</p>
<p>Walon Iberia is a Spanish affiliate of international freight firm Groupe Walon.</p>
<p>In a statement, Chargeurs International said it was continuing negotiations aimed at ending its activities in the transport and automobile services sectors in Europe.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
